{
  "schema": "planning-case/v1",
  "id": "fare-cap-comparison-pass-wins",
  "prompt": "The three committed rides use the same synthetic rider, date, eligible payment medium and fare zone; the daily cap applies. Compare capped-payg = min(sum of committed ride fares, cap) with day-pass. Select one cheapest option, allowing ties. Calculation is capped-payg total in AUD. Pending lists unknown price facts; a comparison with unknown eligible cost must defer.",
  "facts": {
